      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: Kiss and Tell (1945 film). Kiss and Tell is a 1945 American comedy film starring then 17-year-old Shirley Temple as Corliss Archer. In the film, two teenage girls cause their respective parents much concern when they start to become interested in boys. The parents' bickering about which girl is the worse influence causes more problems than it solves.",
